{
  "title": "chat-service — Overview",
  "uid": "chat-service-overview",
  "tags": ["chat-service", "observabilidade", "fatia-a"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mensagens/s",
      "description": "Publicacoes CONFIRMADAS no broker (callback de sucesso), nao tentativas. Usa rate() de proposito: serie de instancia morta contribui por ~5min e decai sozinha — isso e media movel, nao bug. Nao trocar por last_over_time aqui.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(chat_messages_sent_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "mensagens/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Usuarios Online",
      "description": "DEFASAGEM DE ATE 90s EM SCALE-DOWN. Push OTLP nao emite stale marker, entao a janela de 90s (3x o step de 30s) substitui o lookback de 300s do Mimir. Nao aperte a janela abaixo de 3x o step: com 2x, uma unica falha de push faz a instancia sumir e o painel pisca para baixo. Conta usuarios (principal), nao sessoes — 2 abas = 1.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "decimals": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(last_over_time(chat_users_online[90s]))",
          "legendFormat": "online"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas de publicacao Kafka",
      "description": "Counters pre-registrados com 0 no boot para todos os topicos conhecidos. Por isso 'sem dados' aqui significa 'a app parou de reportar', e nao 'nunca houve falha' — os dois casos seriam indistinguiveis sem o pre-registro.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(chat_kafka_publish_failures_total[5m])) by (topic)",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag por topico",
      "description": "max, nao sum: somar particoes vivas com particoes-fantasma de instancia morta e ruido. Mesma janela de 90s do gauge de online, pelo mesmo motivo (staleness de push).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(last_over_time(kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag[90s])) by (topic)",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer lag por particao (valida a Fatia B)",
      "description": "Existe porque 'max by (topic)' ESCONDE uma particao travada quando as outras estao saudaveis — e a particao travada e justamente o sinal que valida o fan-out. Hoje todo topico tem uma particao so; este painel fica util quando isso mudar.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(last_over_time(kafka_consumer_fetch_manager_records_lag[90s])) by (topic, partition)",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}} / p{{partition}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM heap usado",
      "description": "Verificado no Explore: retorna as tres regioes do G1 (Eden, Old Gen, Survivor). O sum() by (instance) agrega as tres — e o heap total por instancia, nao por regiao.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(last_over_time(jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"}[90s])) by (instance)",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP — p95 e throughput",
      "description": "Nomes confirmados no Explore: http_server_requests_milliseconds_{bucket,count,sum}. Atencao ao sufixo — este setup exporta duracoes em MILISSEGUNDOS, nao em segundos.\n\nO _bucket existe SEM precisar ligar percentiles-histogram: o registry OTLP do Micrometer exporta Timer como histograma de buckets explicitos por padrao (diferente do registry Prometheus). Ou seja, o custo de cardinalidade dos buckets ja esta sendo pago — o p95 sai de graca.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "req/s" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "reqps" }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
